    <!--
      RDA WIZARD ORIGINAL ICON SET — v1 (original vector geometry; no proprietary assets).
      Grid: chrome/action icons on 24x24 with 1.5px stroke discipline, round caps+joins;
      device/status tiles filled on 20x20; file-type tiles filled 20x20 with 2-letter labels
      rendered by the Icon control (not baked into geometry).
      Sources of the INVENTORY (what icons exist): IRX taxonomy + QSS qproperty families
      (DESIGN-SYSTEM §6.1); the ART is original (session mandate: reference-faithful
      language, no copied assets). Interim sourcing note: none — these are bespoke v1
      paths; INTERIM-ASSETS.md tracks the v2 upgrade plan (hinted per-size variants).
      Naming: Icon.<Category>.<Name>. Stroke icons render with IconStyle=Chrome
      (stroke, no fill); filled render IconStyle=Solid (fill, no stroke).
    -->

